    <string name="defaults_need_pairing">Pair first to save these on the server.</string>

    <string name="privacy_title">Privacy</string>
    <string name="privacy_text">The microphone is on only while you dictate; the button turns red and pulses while it is on. Audio goes to your organisation\'s server and is never saved on this phone; it is kept in memory only until its text arrives. Whether text history is kept on the server is a setting of your account (off by default). Dictation is turned off in password fields.</string>
